  "problem_name": "Pairwise AND sum",
  "intended_contest_code": "LTIME03",
  "body": "<p>You are given a sequence of <b>N</b> integer numbers <b>A</b>. Calculate the sum of <b>A<sub>i</sub> AND A<sub>j</sub></b> for all the pairs (<b>i</b>, <b>j</b>) where <b>i < j</b>. </p>\r\n<p> The <b>AND</b> operation is the <b>Bitwise AND</b> operation, defined as in <a href = http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND>here</a>. </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Input</h3>\r\n<p>The first line of input consists of the integer <b>N</b>. <br>\r\nThe second line contains <b>N</b> integer numbers - the sequence <b>A</b>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Output</h3>\r\n<p>Output the answer to the problem on the first line of the output.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Example</h3>\r\n<pre><b>Input:</b>\r\n5\r\n1 2 3 4 5\r\n\r\n<b>Output:</b>\r\n9\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n<h3>Scoring</h3>\r\n<p>\r\nSubtask 1 (13 points): <b>N</b> <= 1000, <b>A<sub>i</sub></b> <= 1. <br>\r\nSubtask 2 (39 points): <b>N</b> <= 1000, <b>A<sub>i</sub></b> <= 10<sup>9</sup>. <br>\r\nSubtask 3 (21 points): <b>N</b> <= 10<sup>5</sup>, <b>A<sub>i</sub></b> <= 1. <br>\r\nSubtask 4 (27 points): <b>N</b> <= 10<sup>5</sup>, <b>A<sub>i</sub></b> <= 10<sup>6</sup>. </p>\n<aside style='background: #f8f8f8;padding: 10px 15px;'><div>All submissions for this problem are available.</div></aside>",
